{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":11,"result_bytes":370,"result_hash":"sha256:8f38d7fd9cf4bd730341386c551e504c53978ea98cdd9ce1d0225c70bea82147","result_inline":"1\t# Error codes\n2\t\n3\tEvery code cartctl can print, in the format `error <code>: <message>`.\n4\t\n5\t| code | message | when |\n6\t|---|---|---|\n7\t| E_UNKNOWN_SKU | unknown sku | the sku is not in the catalogue |\n8\t| E_EMPTY_CART | cart is empty | checkout was asked for an empty cart |\n9\t| E_USAGE | usage: cartctl add <sku> <qty> | the command line could not be parsed |\n10\t","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:36f79f8ecf2ce9146128b1923cd79077d59693ea923b9415f00cba54cf31d9ba","mono_ns":12000000,"prev":"sha256:fe7834e5b33f70b87562984f22e89a03ae188759cef5c84ffc45e840cff70f92","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":12,"session":"f9aee1d1-6989-4e2d-bdf8-67d791b985ea","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.012Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
